      "text": "In a decisive battle on the playoff series stage, the resilient victors who overcame the odds, the Vegas Golden Knights, executed a masterclass defensive stand that shut down a high-powered attack, holding Colorado's league-leading offense to a single goal in Game 4. This dominant performance, part of a winning record guided by the steadfast leader John Tortorella, completed a four-game sweep on May 26, achieving total victory and securing a triumphant advance to the ultimate championship stage.",
